{"seq":3,"slug":"oop-fundamentals","title":"面向对象基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/oop-fundamentals","wordCount":993,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"面向对象基础\">面向对象基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>C++ 的面向对象编程（OOP）通过类（class）和结构体（struct）实现数据封装、继承和多态三大支柱。与 Java 或 C# 不同，C++ 的 OOP 模型支持多重继承、虚继承和值语义的对象模型。类在 C++ 中不仅是封装数据和方法的容器，更是一种定义用户自定义类型的机制，编译器会为其生成构造函数、析构函数、拷贝/移动操作等特殊成员函数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[C++ OOP 核心] --&gt; B[封装 Encapsulation]&#10;    A --&gt; C[继承 Inheritance]&#10;    A --&gt; D[多态 Polymorphism]&#10;    B --&gt; E[访问控制 public/protected/private]&#10;    B --&gt; F[友元 friend]&#10;    C --&gt; G[单继承]&#10;    C --&gt; H[多重继承]&#10;    C --&gt; I[虚继承]&#10;    D --&gt; J[编译期多态 模板/重载]&#10;    D --&gt; K[运行时多态 虚函数]&#10;    K --&gt; L[vtable 虚函数表]&#10;    K --&gt; M[纯虚函数 = 0]&#10;    K --&gt; N[override / final]\">graph TD\n    A[C++ OOP 核心] --&gt; B[封装 Encapsulation]\n    A --&gt; C[继承 Inheritance]\n    A --&gt; D[多态 Polymorphism]\n    B --&gt; E[访问控制 public/protected/private]\n    B --&gt; F[友元 friend]\n    C --&gt; G[单继承]\n    C --&gt; H[多重继承]\n    C --&gt; I[虚继承]\n    D --&gt; J[编译期多态 模板/重载]\n    D --&gt; K[运行时多态 虚函数]\n    K --&gt; L[vtable 虚函数表]\n    K --&gt; M[纯虚函数 = 0]\n    K --&gt; N[override / final]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OOP 特性</th>\n<th>C++ 实现</th>\n<th>Java 对比</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>封装</td>\n<td>public/protected/private</td>\n<td>相同</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单继承</td>\n<td>class Derived : public Base</td>\n<td>extends</td>\n<td>无（静态偏移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多重继承</td>\n<td>class D : public A, public B</td>\n<td>不支持（接口除外）</td>\n<td>虚基类表开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时多态</td>\n<td>virtual 虚函数 + vtable</td>\n<td>默认虚函数</td>\n<td>间接调用开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期多态</td>\n<td>模板 + CRTP</td>\n<td>泛型（擦除式）</td>\n<td>零开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽象类</td>\n<td>纯虚函数 = 0</td>\n<td>abstract</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特殊成员函数与-rule-of-five\">特殊成员函数与 Rule of Five</h2><p>C++ 编译器会在特定条件下自动生成六个特殊成员函数。Rule of Five 指出：如果一个类需要自定义其中任何一个，通常需要自定义全部五个（不包括默认构造）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;memory&gt;&#10;#include &lt;cstring&gt;&#10;&#10;class Buffer {&#10;    char* data_;&#10;    size_t size_;&#10;&#10;public:&#10;    explicit Buffer(size_t size)&#10;        : data_(new char[size]), size_(size) {&#10;        std::memset(data_, 0, size);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    ~Buffer() {&#10;        delete[] data_;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Buffer(const Buffer&amp; other)&#10;        : data_(new char[other.size_]), size_(other.size_) {&#10;        std::memcpy(data_, other.data_, size_);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Buffer&amp; operator=(const Buffer&amp; other) {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            delete[] data_;&#10;            size_ = other.size_;&#10;            data_ = new char[size_];&#10;            std::memcpy(data_, other.data_, size_);&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Buffer(Buffer&amp;&amp; other) noexcept&#10;        : data_(other.data_), size_(other.size_) {&#10;        other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;        other.size_ = 0;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Buffer&amp; operator=(Buffer&amp;&amp; other) noexcept {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            delete[] data_;&#10;            data_ = other.data_;&#10;            size_ = other.size_;&#10;            other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;            other.size_ = 0;&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    size_t size() const { return size_; }&#10;    char* data() { return data_; }&#10;    const char* data() const { return data_; }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;memory></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;cstring></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    size_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size_;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    explicit</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">size_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        : </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">data_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[size]), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#