e\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    CRTPRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) : </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">w_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    double</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> area_impl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h_; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> draw_impl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /* 绘制矩形 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typename</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Shape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShapeBase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> shape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shape.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>多态方式</th>\n<th>分发时机</th>\n<th>内存开销</th>\n<th>调用开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>虚函数</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>vptr（8字节/对象）</td>\n<td>间接跳转</td>\n<td>异质容器、插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRTP</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>直接调用（可内联）</td>\n<td>高性能数值计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>std::variant + visit</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>最大类型对齐</td>\n<td>switch 分发</td>\n<td>封闭类型集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>C++ OOP 通过 class 实现封装、继承和多态，支持多重继承和值语义对象模型</li>\n<li>Rule of Five：自定义析构函数时通常需要同时定义拷贝/移动构造和赋值运算符</li>\n<li>Rule of Zero：优先使用智能指针和 STL 容器，让编译器自动生成正确的特殊成员函数</li>\n<li>虚函数通过 vtable + vptr 实现运行时多态，override 和 final 关键字增强类型安全</li>\n<li>CRTP 通过模板继承实现零开销编译期多态，适合高性能场景</li>\n<li>编译期多态（模板、CRTP）是零开销的，在性能敏感场景优于运行时多态</li>\n<li>现代 C++ 推荐组合优于继承，使用 std::variant 替代简单的继承层次结构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../templates-generics/function-templates\">函数模板</a>——本篇 CRTP 实现的编译期多态依赖模板机制，先理解模板参数推导与实例化。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../memory-management/raii-smart-pointers\">RAII 与智能指针</a>——Rule of Five/Zero 在本篇是 OOP 的特殊成员函数设计，这里展开为资源管理范式。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../type-systems/inference-and-polymorphism/polymorphism\">类型系统·多态</a>——把虚函数（子类型多态）与 CRTP/模板（参数多态）放进多态的统一分类框架中理解。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../go-language/interfaces-and-generics/interface-design\">Go·接口设计</a>——Go 用隐式接口和组合替代继承层次，对比 C++「组合优于继承」建议背后的不同语言哲学。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"面向对象基础","id":"面向对象基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"特殊成员函数与 Rule of Five","id":"特殊成员函数与-rule-of-five"},{"level":2,"text":"虚函数与运行时多态","id":"虚函数与运行时多态"},{"level":2,"text":"CRTP 与编译期多态","id":"crtp-与编译期多态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"指针与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/pointers-references"},"next":{"title":"栈与堆内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/stack-heap"}}